## 為電子商務網站打造前端界面的完整流程

下面的步驟從「想法到落地」給你一個清晰的路線圖，涵蓋設計、技術選型、開發、測試與部署。你可以根據自己的需求和團隊能力靈活調整。

| 步驟 | 目標 | 具體做法 | 工具 / 技術 |
|------|------|----------|-------------|
| 1. 需求梳理 | 明確功能、用戶場景 | - 用戶故事<br>- 功能清單（商品列表、搜尋、篩選、購物車、結帳、會員中心等） | - Trello / Jira / Notion |
| 2. UI/UX 設計 | 視覺風格、交互流程 | - 先畫紙上草圖<br>- 進行高保真原型（Figma / Sketch）<br>- 設計色彩、字體、圖標 | - Figma / Adobe XD / Sketch |
| 3. 技術棧決策 | 前端框架、樣式、狀態管理 | - **框架**：React / Vue / Angular<br>- **樣式**：Tailwind / Bootstrap / CSS Modules / Styled‑Components<br>- **狀態**：Redux / Zustand / Pinia / NgRx<br>- **API**：REST / GraphQL | - React + Vite + Tailwind + Redux Toolkit |
| 4. 原型實現 | 快速驗證 UI | - 使用 Storybook 或 Styleguidist 逐個組件開發<br>- 先寫靜態頁面，後接 API | - Storybook |
| 5. 整合後端 | 資料流、認證 | - Axios / Fetch 與後端 API 通訊<br>- JWT / OAuth2 認證<br>- WebSocket（如即時聊天） | - Axios |
| 6. 性能優化 | 加載速度、SEO | - 代碼分割（React.lazy / Vue.lazy）<br>- 圖片懶加載（lazysizes）<br>- SSR / SSG（Next.js / Nuxt.js）<br>- CDN、緩存 | - Next.js |
| 7. 測試 | 稳定性 | - 單元測試（Jest + React Testing Library / Vue Test Utils）<br>- 集成測試<br>- E2E 測試（Cypress / Playwright） | - Jest / Cypress |
| 8. CI/CD | 自動化部署 | - GitHub Actions / GitLab CI<br>- Docker 化<br>- 部署到 Vercel / Netlify / Render / AWS Amplify | - GitHub Actions |
| 9. 上線監控 | 追蹤錯誤、性能 | - Sentry、LogRocket<br>- Google Analytics / Mixpanel<br>- New Relic | - Sentry |

---

## 具體實作示例（React + Vite + Tailwind）

### 1. 初始化專案

```bash
npm create vite@latest ecommerce-frontend -- --template react
cd ecommerce-frontend
npm i
```

### 2. 安裝依賴

```bash
npm i tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
npm i axios react-router-dom @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux
npm i -D jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom @testing-library/user-event
```

### 3. 配置 Tailwind

`tailwind.config.js`

```js
module.exports = {
  content: [
    "./index.html",
    "./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}",
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

`src/index.css`

```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
```

### 4. 建立基本路由

`src/App.jsx`

```jsx
import { BrowserRouter as Router, Routes, Route } from 'react-router-dom';
import Home from './pages/Home';
import ProductDetail from './pages/ProductDetail';
import Cart from './pages/Cart';
import Checkout from './pages/Checkout';

function App() {
  return (
    <Router>
      <Routes>
        <Route path="/" element={<Home />} />
        <Route path="/product/:id" element={<ProductDetail />} />
        <Route path="/cart" element={<Cart />} />
        <Route path="/checkout" element={<Checkout />} />
      </Routes>
    </Router>
  );
}

export default App;
```

### 5. Redux Store（簡易購物車）

`src/store/cartSlice.js`

```js
import { createSlice } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';

const cartSlice = createSlice({
  name: 'cart',
  initialState: { items: [] },
  reducers: {
    addItem: (state, action) => {
      const existing = state.items.find(i => i.id === action.payload.id);
      if (existing) {
        existing.quantity += action.payload.quantity;
      } else {
        state.items.push(action.payload);
      }
    },
    removeItem: (state, action) => {
      state.items = state.items.filter(i => i.id !== action.payload);
    },
    clearCart: state => {
      state.items = [];
    },
  },
});

export const { addItem, removeItem, clearCart } = cartSlice.actions;
export default cartSlice.reducer;
```

`src/store/index.js`

```js
import { configureStore } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';
import cartReducer from './cartSlice';

export default configureStore({
  reducer: {
    cart: cartReducer,
  },
});
```

`src/main.jsx`

```jsx
import React from 'react';
import ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client';
import App from './App';
import './index.css';
import { Provider } from 'react-redux';
import store from './store';

ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')).render(
  <React.StrictMode>
    <Provider store={store}>
      <App />
    </Provider>
  </React.StrictMode>
);
```

### 6. API 呼叫範例

`src/api/products.js`

```js
import axios from 'axios';

const api = axios.create({
  baseURL: 'https://api.example.com',
});

export const fetchProducts = () => api.get('/products');
export const fetchProductById = id => api.get(`/products/${id}`);
```

### 7. 產品列表頁

`src/pages/Home.jsx`

```jsx
import { useEffect, useState } from 'react';
import { fetchProducts } from '../api/products';
import { Link } from 'react-router-dom';
import { useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { addItem } from '../store/cartSlice';

export default function Home() {
  const [products, setProducts] = useState([]);
  const dispatch = useDispatch();

  useEffect(() => {
    fetchProducts().then(res => setProducts(res.data));
  }, []);

  const handleAddToCart = product => {
    dispatch(addItem({ ...product, quantity: 1 }));
  };

  return (
    <div className="container mx-auto p-4">
      <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">商品列表</h1>
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {products.map(p => (
          <div key={p.id} className="border rounded p-2 flex flex-col">
            <Link to={`/product/${p.id}`}>
              <img src={p.image} alt={p.name} className="h-48 w-full object-cover mb-2" />
              <h2 className="font-semibold">{p.name}</h2>
            </Link>
            <p className="mt-auto">${p.price}</p>
            <button
              onClick={() => handleAddToCart(p)}
              className="mt-2 bg-blue-500 text-white py-1 px-3 rounded"
            >
              加入購物車
            </button>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 8. 測試範例（Jest + React Testing Library）

`src/__tests__/Home.test.jsx`

```jsx
import { render, screen, waitFor } from '@testing-library/react';
import Home from '../pages/Home';
import { Provider } from 'react-redux';
import store from '../store';
import { rest } from 'msw';
import { setupServer } from 'msw/node';

const server = setupServer(
  rest.get('https://api.example.com/products', (req, res, ctx) => {
    return res(
      ctx.json([
        { id: 1, name: 'Test Product', price: 99, image: '/test.jpg' },
      ])
    );
  })
);

beforeAll(() => server.listen());
afterEach(() => server.resetHandlers());
afterAll(() => server.close());

test('renders product list', async () => {
  render(
    <Provider store={store}>
      <Home />
    </Provider>
  );

  await waitFor(() => expect(screen.getByText('Test Product')).toBeInTheDocument());
});
```

